/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Neural\040Networks\040for\040Nonlinear\040Dynamic\040System\040Modelling\040and\040Identification)
/Author (Sheng\040Chen\054\040Stephen\040A\056\040Billings)
/Subject (Many\040real\055world\040systems\040exhibit\040complex\040nonlinear\040characteristics\040and\040cannot\040be\040treated\040satisfactorily\040using\040linear\040systems\040theory\056\040A\040neural\040network\040which\040has\040the\040ability\040to\040learn\040sophisticated\040nonlinear\040relationships\040provides\040an\040ideal\040means\040of\040modelling\040complicated\040nonlinear\040systems\056\040This\040paper\040addresses\040the\040issues\040related\040to\040the\040identification\040of\040nonlinear\040discrete\055time\040dynamic\040systems\040using\040neural\040networks\056\040Three\040network\040architectures\054\040namely\040the\040multi\055layer\040perceptron\054\040the\040radial\040basis\040function\040network\040and\040the\040functional\055link\040network\054\040are\040presented\040and\040several\040learning\040or\040identification\040algorithms\040are\040derived\056\040Advantages\040and\040disadvantages\040of\040these\040structures\040are\040discussed\040and\040illustrated\040using\040simulated\040and\040real\040data\056\040Particular\040attention\040is\040given\040to\040the\040connections\040between\040existing\040techniques\040for\040nonlinear\040systems\040identification\040and\040some\040aspects\040of\040neural\040network\040methodology\054\040and\040this\040demonstrates\040that\040certain\040techniques\040employed\040in\040the\040neural\040network\040context\040have\040long\040been\040developed\040by\040the\040control\040e\056\056\056)
/Keywords (01\040Aug\0401992\054\040International\040Journal\040of\040Control\054\040Nonlinear\040system\040identification\054\040Recurrent\040neural\040network\054\040Nervous\040system\040network\040models\054\040Radial\040basis\040function\040network\054\040Artificial\040neural\040network\054\040University\040of\040Edinburgh\054\040University\040of\040Sheffield)
>>
